{"id":"5e8566af43ba9205","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/876_带括号_Lambek_演算.md","title":"876 带括号 Lambek 演算","display":"876_带括号_Lambek_演算","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"876-带括号-Lambek-演算\">876 带括号 Lambek 演算</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 为范畴原子集合。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv},\\operatorname{br},\\operatorname{unbr}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv},\\operatorname{br},\\operatorname{unbr}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 为这些构造子生成的最小闭包。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{br},\\operatorname{unbr}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{br},\\operatorname{unbr}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[]^{-1}A\">\\([]^{-1}A\\)</span> 分别表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{br}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{br}(A)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{unbr}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{unbr}(A)\\)</span>。带括号 Lambek 演算在后文使用显式括号节点。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式与替换\">2. 公式与替换</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 是最小集合，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{br}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{br}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{unbr}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{unbr}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{prod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{prod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{br}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{unbr}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{br}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{unbr}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{prod}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{prod}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ldiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ldiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{rdiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rdiv}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{rdiv}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{br}(A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{br}(A[\\sigma]),\\quad\n\\operatorname{unbr}(A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{unbr}(A[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{br}(A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{br}(A[\\sigma]),\\quad\n\\operatorname{unbr}(A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{unbr}(A[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。定义绑定原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>固定新鲜原子选择函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{BL}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{BL}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于没有绑定名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{BL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{BL}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{BL}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{BL}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-带括号结构树\">3. 带括号结构树</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{BTree}\">\\(\\mathsf{BTree}\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A\\rangle_{\\mathsf f}\">\\(\\langle A\\rangle_{\\mathsf f}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{node}(X,Y)\">\\(\\operatorname{node}(X,Y)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{brnode}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{brnode}(X)\\)</span> 生成。洞上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{BHole}\">\\(\\mathsf{BHole}\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{node}(H,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{node}(H,X)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{node}(X,H)\">\\(\\operatorname{node}(X,H)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{brnode}(H)\">\\(\\operatorname{brnode}(H)\\)</span> 生成。填洞函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}\">\\(\\operatorname{plug}\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\Box,X)=X,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\Box,X)=X,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{node}(H,Y),X)=\\operatorname{node}(\\operatorname{plug}(H,X),Y),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{node}(H,Y),X)=\\operatorname{node}(\\operatorname{plug}(H,X),Y),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{node}(Y,H),X)=\\operatorname{node}(Y,\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{node}(Y,H),X)=\\operatorname{node}(Y,\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{brnode}(H),X)=\\operatorname{brnode}(\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{brnode}(H),X)=\\operatorname{brnode}(\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义洞的括号深度函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bdepth}:\\mathsf{BHole}\\to\\mathbb N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bdepth}:\\mathsf{BHole}\\to\\mathbb N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bdepth}(\\Box)=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bdepth}(\\Box)=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bdepth}(\\operatorname{node}(H,X))=\\operatorname{bdepth}(H),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bdepth}(\\operatorname{node}(X,H))=\\operatorname{bdepth}(H),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bdepth}(\\operatorname{node}(H,X))=\\operatorname{bdepth}(H),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bdepth}(\\operatorname{node}(X,H))=\\operatorname{bdepth}(H),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bdepth}(\\operatorname{brnode}(H))=\\operatorname{bdepth}(H)+1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bdepth}(\\operatorname{brnode}(H))=\\operatorname{bdepth}(H)+1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义括号许可洞</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Permit}_{\\mathsf{out}}(H)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{bdepth}(H)=0,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Permit}_{\\mathsf{in}}(H)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{bdepth}(H)\\ge 1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Permit}_{\\mathsf{out}}(H)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{bdepth}(H)=0,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Permit}_{\\mathsf{in}}(H)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{bdepth}(H)\\ge 1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>序列集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}=\\{X\\Rightarrow A:X\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Seq}=\\{X\\Rightarrow A:X\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理\">4. 公理</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BL}}=\\{\\langle A\\rangle_{\\mathsf f}\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BL}}=\\{\\langle A\\rangle_{\\mathsf f}\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-Lambek-规则\">5. Lambek 规则</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Seq}^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Seq}^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以下每个 Lambek 规则族与第 6 节每个括号规则族均是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}\">\\(\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}\\)</span> 的子集。</p>\n<p>约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1};Q):=((Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1}),Q)\">\\((Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1};Q):=((Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1}),Q)\\)</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(();Q):=((),Q)\">\\((();Q):=((),Q)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义乘积右规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot R}=\n\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(Y\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{node}(X,Y)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot R}=\n\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(Y\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{node}(X,Y)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义乘积左规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot L}=\n\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(\\langle A\\rangle_{\\mathsf f},\\langle B\\rangle_{\\mathsf f}))\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\rangle_{\\mathsf f})\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{BHole},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot L}=\n\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(\\langle A\\rangle_{\\mathsf f},\\langle B\\rangle_{\\mathsf f}))\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\rangle_{\\mathsf f})\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{BHole},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义左除右规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}=\n\\{((\\operatorname{node}(\\langle A\\rangle_{\\mathsf f},X)\\Rightarrow B);X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)):X\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}=\n\\{((\\operatorname{node}(\\langle A\\rangle_{\\mathsf f},X)\\Rightarrow B);X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)):X\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义右除右规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}=\n\\{((\\operatorname{node}(X,\\langle A\\rangle_{\\mathsf f})\\Rightarrow B);X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A)):X\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}=\n\\{((\\operatorname{node}(X,\\langle A\\rangle_{\\mathsf f})\\Rightarrow B);X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A)):X\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义左除左规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}=\n\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle B\\rangle_{\\mathsf f})\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(\\langle\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\rangle_{\\mathsf f},X))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{BHole},X\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}=\n\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle B\\rangle_{\\mathsf f})\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(\\langle\\operatorname{ldiv}(A,B)\\rangle_{\\mathsf f},X))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{BHole},X\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义右除左规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}=\n\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle B\\rangle_{\\mathsf f})\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(X,\\langle\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A)\\rangle_{\\mathsf f}))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{BHole},X\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}=\n\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle B\\rangle_{\\mathsf f})\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{node}(X,\\langle\\operatorname{rdiv}(B,A)\\rangle_{\\mathsf f}))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{BHole},X\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-括号规则\">6. 括号规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{br}R}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A);\\operatorname{brnode}(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{br}(A)):X\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{br}R}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A);\\operatorname{brnode}(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{br}(A)):X\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{br}L}=\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{brnode}(\\langle A\\rangle_{\\mathsf f}))\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle\\operatorname{br}(A)\\rangle_{\\mathsf f})\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{BHole},A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{Permit}_{\\mathsf{out}}(H)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{br}L}=\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{brnode}(\\langle A\\rangle_{\\mathsf f}))\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle\\operatorname{br}(A)\\rangle_{\\mathsf f})\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{BHole},A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{Permit}_{\\mathsf{out}}(H)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{unbr}R}=\\{((\\operatorname{brnode}(X)\\Rightarrow A);X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{unbr}(A)):X\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{unbr}R}=\\{((\\operatorname{brnode}(X)\\Rightarrow A);X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{unbr}(A)):X\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{unbr}L}=\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle A\\rangle_{\\mathsf f})\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{brnode}(\\langle\\operatorname{unbr}(A)\\rangle_{\\mathsf f}))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{BHole},A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{Permit}_{\\mathsf{in}}(H)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{unbr}L}=\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle A\\rangle_{\\mathsf f})\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{brnode}(\\langle\\operatorname{unbr}(A)\\rangle_{\\mathsf f}))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{BHole},A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{Permit}_{\\mathsf{in}}(H)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义割规则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle A\\rangle_{\\mathsf f})\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)\\Rightarrow B):H\\in\\mathsf{BHole},X\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle A\\rangle_{\\mathsf f})\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)\\Rightarrow B):H\\in\\mathsf{BHole},X\\in\\mathsf{BTree},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{BL}}=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{br}R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{br}L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{unbr}R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{unbr}L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{BL}}=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\cdot L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{br}R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{br}L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{unbr}R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{unbr}L}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明树\">7. 证明树</h1>\n<p>有限有根有序树是四元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\">\\((T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in T\">\\(r\\in T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 无父节点，其余节点有唯一父节点；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 无环且每个节点沿父关系有限步到达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(u)\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(u)\\)</span> 无重复地有限列举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的全部直接子节点。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BL}}(X,A)\">\\(\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BL}}(X,A)\\)</span> 是所有五元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\">\\((T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\)</span> 的集合，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\">\\((T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\)</span> 是上述树，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\">\\(\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(r)=X\\Rightarrow A\">\\(\\ell(r)=X\\Rightarrow A\\)</span>，并且每个节点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in T\">\\(u\\in T\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 没有直接子节点且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BL}}\">\\(\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(u)=(u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(u)=(u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1})\\)</span>，并且</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl((\\ell(u_0),\\ldots,\\ell(u_{n-1})),\\ell(u)\\bigr)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{BL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl((\\ell(u_0),\\ldots,\\ell(u_{n-1})),\\ell(u)\\bigr)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{BL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可导性\">8. 可导性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\vdash_{\\mathsf{BL}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BL}}(X,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\vdash_{\\mathsf{BL}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BL}}(X,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{BL}}(Q)=\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell):(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BL}}(X,A)\\text{ 对某个 }X,A\\text{，且 }\\ell(r)=Q\\},\n\\quad Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{BL}}(Q)=\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell):(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BL}}(X,A)\\text{ 对某个 }X,A\\text{，且 }\\ell(r)=Q\\},\n\\quad Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义证明证书集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{BL}}(X,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BL}}(X,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{BL}}(X,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BL}}(X,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义可导相继式集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{BL}}\n=\n\\{X\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Seq}:X\\vdash_{\\mathsf{BL}}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{BL}}\n=\n\\{X\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Seq}:X\\vdash_{\\mathsf{BL}}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>带括号 Lambek 演算的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{BL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{BTree},\n\\mathsf{BHole},\n\\operatorname{bdepth},\n\\operatorname{Permit}_{\\mathsf{out}},\n\\operatorname{Permit}_{\\mathsf{in}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{br}R},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{br}L},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{unbr}R},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{unbr}L},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{BL}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{BL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{BTree},\n\\mathsf{BHole},\n\\operatorname{bdepth},\n\\operatorname{Permit}_{\\mathsf{out}},\n\\operatorname{Permit}_{\\mathsf{in}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{br}R},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{br}L},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{unbr}R},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{unbr}L},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{BL}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{BL}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{BL}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{BL}},\\mathsf{BTree},\\mathsf{BHole},\\operatorname{plug},\\operatorname{bdepth},\\operatorname{Permit}_{\\mathsf{out}},\\operatorname{Permit}_{\\mathsf{in}},\\mathsf{Seq},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BL}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{br}R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{br}L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{unbr}R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{unbr}L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{BL}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BL}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{BL}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{BL}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{BL}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{BL}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{BL}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{BL}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{BL}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{BL}},\\mathsf{BTree},\\mathsf{BHole},\\operatorname{plug},\\operatorname{bdepth},\\operatorname{Permit}_{\\mathsf{out}},\\operatorname{Permit}_{\\mathsf{in}},\\mathsf{Seq},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BL}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{br}R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{br}L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{unbr}R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\operatorname{unbr}L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{BL}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{BL}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{BL}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{BL}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{BL}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{BL}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{BL}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义带括号结构的 Lambek 句法证明关系；不定义外部语义、解析算法或结构后处理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"876-带括号-Lambek-演算","text":"876 带括号 Lambek 演算","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与替换","text":"2. 公式与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-带括号结构树","text":"3. 带括号结构树","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理","text":"4. 公理","level":1},{"id":"5.-Lambek-规则","text":"5. Lambek 规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-括号规则","text":"6. 括号规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明树","text":"7. 证明树","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导性","text":"8. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv},\\operatorname{br},\\operatorname{unbr}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{ldiv},\\operatorname{rdiv}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{br},\\operatorname{unbr}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle A\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"[]^{-1}A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{br}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{unbr}(A